                                "sense_id": "97d6d015-97e9-30c6-9b7b-a38957d18f1f",
                                "text": "A lotta times I grabbed bags of frozen chicken nuggets to take home. “You know what they say,” Ricky would be like. “Dude's gotta have nugs.”"
